{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "8cdf04a726783ac45df572252c6b29e28f33d9999fb8a8625f56ab320d383a38", "ja": "グラビア撮影　本番前", "zh": "写真拍摄　正式开拍前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6000_place", "source_sha256": "d4791fb11477fe30ba4df1a8faada2b28b2b8855f65e1a06166ed650c671fc94", "ja": "公園", "zh": "公园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6001_p", "source_sha256": "1b44725e4e0a666b137607bb88e018c52271fb07e650d884f39329daedaa65f1", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n杏奈が犬と遊ぶ姿を撮る予定なのだが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n本来计划拍摄杏奈和狗一起玩耍的样子，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6002_024ann", "source_sha256": "9baae99803a701fa72c56a829f193183e4ff684219fa5aec1066ffc9bc10d8b0", "ja": "ねえ……{$P$}さん……。\n一緒に、撮影するイヌって……もしかして……？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生……\n要和我一起拍摄的狗狗……该不会是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6003_p", "source_sha256": "a5ba3fda5c65c9ed0c11322901b22723668a2d11b327840f29acb7d6ad8de573", "ja": "杏奈も見たか。さっきスタッフさんたちといた\n大型犬がそうだよ。大きくて元気だったな！", "zh": "杏奈也看到了吗？刚才和工作人员在一起的那只大型犬就是哦。又大又精神呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6004_024ann", "source_sha256": "603642b2961fe645b9a1198c2b70ef895ddfd82a723ebbf072590d5b2eab1dd9", "ja": "やっぱり……。スタッフさん……ちょっと、大変そう\nだった……。杏奈より、大きいのかな……？", "zh": "果然是……。工作人​​员……看起来有点、\n辛苦的样子……。它会比、杏奈还大吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6005_p", "source_sha256": "0763665beb4127680dc3022a83d36a0e4a63fa576f29051836d59a6fbb6260a2", "ja": "そうだな……。杏奈が隠れられるサイズかもな。\n体は大きいけど、おとなしい性格らしいぞ。", "zh": "是啊……说不定大到能让杏奈藏进去。身体虽然很大，但听说性格很温顺。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6006_024ann", "source_sha256": "2375db27ccb9c2092c5e35f6daacc5d65a5a7b8cf9bdd153e2eb897ae10f832f", "ja": "そうなの……？　画像はみたけど……性格は、\nわからないから……。ちょっと、びっくり……。", "zh": "是这样吗……？我看过图片了……不过，性格什么的，\n我也不了解……有点惊讶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6007_p", "source_sha256": "b2b6daa304d0297f2f7b12f95c71e027c00a799146976369ce5452153aea390a", "ja": "ははっ。会わないとわからないこともあるからな。\nでも画像を見たって……犬の画像をか？", "zh": "哈哈，有些事不见面是不会知道的。可是你说看了图片……是狗狗的图片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6008_024ann", "source_sha256": "2ee5579c79f2b7d3f0081054b00564a9f1f7d987edaf6d67137efe645680dcf2", "ja": "うん……。イヌと仲良くなる方法、とか……\nお散歩のやり方とか……ネットで、みてきた……。", "zh": "嗯……比如在网上查了怎么和狗狗相处……还有怎么遛狗之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6009_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ea2f9b9fd401417c205746ea145c8dc060c1bd8936fb21596242a1ce00555fe", "ja": "でも、あんなに大きいとは……思わなくて……。\n杏奈……仲良くなれるか、心配……です……。", "zh": "可是，没想到会那么大……  \n杏奈……有点担心自己能不能和它成为朋友……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6010_p", "source_sha256": "a784b99b3b3770d0055c0bd4271da3a219fbbf3709ae4f990f93f5a07e752f6f", "ja": "（杏奈は緊張しているみたいだな……。\n何か安心する言葉をかけてあげないと……！）", "zh": "（杏奈好像很紧张啊……得说些让她安心的话才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6011", "source_sha256": "030dd04041deeff792f3d698131b9e4086fef439c42b08b4d167ffdbcc7e514b", "ja": "抱きつく", "zh": "拥抱", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6012", "source_sha256": "208ca837e7c41077a862f28609c63ab93b306ae7afcffc9bdd08882fde900b69", "ja": "知識を活かす", "zh": "活用知识", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6013", "source_sha256": "2583f9e99c345888ecb04bf3282f65876cb24808ef18077a4d4783c779be0b34", "ja": "真似をする", "zh": "模仿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6100_p", "source_sha256": "1a27ee3bb2ae3d9fabcf074294fc304d4b28844e9b202256b0ba5e6703a0f8c4", "ja": "思い切って、抱きついてみるのはどうだ？\n杏奈の気持ちが伝わって、仲良くなれると思うんだ。", "zh": "索性试着抱上去怎么样？\n我觉得把杏奈的心意传达给它，就能打好关系了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6101_024ann", "source_sha256": "9d5f2093842ec8070ecffc7f62d613b3624ef13a6b5a30dc1904b2d10e2b4627", "ja": "杏奈が……？　もふもふで、温かそう……だけど……。\nおとなしいなら……ほえない、よね……？", "zh": "杏奈要……？毛茸茸的，看起来很温暖……可是……  \n如果很老实……应该不会叫吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6102_024ann", "source_sha256": "530c93b1f8b8eae56f61e726b3652cefa8d091d2625edd5cc0a733a4e0fe4dbd", "ja": "もふもふ……ふふっ。杏奈、楽しみかも……。\nまだ、ちょっと怖いけど……やってみよう、かな……？", "zh": "毛茸茸的……呵呵。杏奈，可能有点期待了……\n虽然还是有点害怕……但试着接触看看……吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6200_p", "source_sha256": "21d19d0a8e82b20d495db3002d29ea49f4883edab28988bdd92cd0eea8baa345", "ja": "杏奈が調べてきたことを活かして、仲良くなろう！\n大きさは違っても犬だからな。きっと通用すると思う。", "zh": "利用杏奈调查到的信息，和它搞好关系吧！\n虽然大小不一样，但毕竟是狗。我想应该会管用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6201_024ann", "source_sha256": "981460f57724b8444de27d69ed32212c852c97afa812e22220a332b27951b2b0", "ja": "そっか……。違う方法を、探さないとって……\n思ったけど……。ちょっと安心……。えへへ……。", "zh": "这样啊……得找别的方法才行……\n本来是这么想的……不过稍微放心了些……嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6202_024ann", "source_sha256": "03abc8f368564ac8b91b5c98e19a9b99544916087c1b553e99eb8341cbf5a61e", "ja": "あとは……攻略法の実践、だね……♪　\nでも、杏奈に……抱っこ、できるのかな……？", "zh": "接下来……就是实践攻略方法了呢……♪\n不过，杏奈……真的能抱起来吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6300_p", "source_sha256": "159ca5c7d626915d320f0ae65f1ee697fbde3812190eb8a26d7c2bb5022d1dd8", "ja": "ほら、ゲームの職業にも、猛獣使いとかあるだろ？\nそれを真似してみたら、仲良くなれたり……。", "zh": "你看，游戏里的职业不是也有驯兽师之类的吗？\n要是模仿一下，说不定就能和它们……变得要好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6301_024ann", "source_sha256": "38a7a3e9660bdd88556f38568329bee3b59b397dfc78a760ebbe9df1c9402833", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。あれは……\nゲームだから……できるんじゃない、かな……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。那是……因为是游戏……才做得到的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_6302_024ann", "source_sha256": "d821592fd75943be16e4f9f59388d98645cbfd2ec27c1b6c99001091b4d9fee2", "ja": "それに、猛獣使いは……体力勝負……。杏奈には……\n絶対、ムリ……。別の方法……考え、ます……。", "zh": "而且，驯兽师……是很考验体力的工作……杏奈……绝对做不到……还是……想想别的办法……吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
